  "body": "Modern, stylish and designed for easy living, this exciting collection of completed townhouses places you right in the heart of sought-after Takapuna.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of the North Shore lifestyle with Takapuna Beach, Lake Pupuke, cafés, restaurants, shopping and excellent transport connections all close by. With a choice of thoughtfully designed homes, there is an opportunity to find the space and layout that suits your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAvailable Options:\r\n* Lots 1-3: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, single garage, 145sqm floor area (more or less)\r\n* Lot 4: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 car parks, 139sqm floor area (more or less)\r\n* Lot 5: 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, 2 car parks, 167sqm floor area (more or less)\r\n* Lot 6: 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, 2 car parks, 165sqm floor area (more or less)\r\n* Lots 7-11: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 car parks, 155sqm floor area (more or less)\r\n\r\nMore Reasons to Love It:\r\n* Completed and ready to move in\r\n* 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty Insurance\r\n* Residential Society levy approx. $2,000 p.a., including building insurance\r\n* Zoned for Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls' High School and Takapuna Grammar School\r\n* Easy walk to Lake Pupuke and Takapuna Beach\r\n* Moments from Takapuna's vibrant cafés, restaurants and shopping\r\n* Convenient motorway access to both the Northern and Southern Motorways\r\n\r\nSOLD - Unit 2\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a stylish new home, a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle or an opportunity in one of Auckland's most established and desirable suburbs, this is a location that delivers.\r\n\r\nOpportunities in Takapuna don't come along every day. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
